// Per-level intro panels for the Learn ("roadmap") path. Before the first
// question of a level, the lesson runner shows a short info panel explaining
// what that section is about and the core principle of the topic, so the
// learner has context before answering. Each blurb is kept under ~300
// characters and is indexed by GLOBAL level number (level 1 = index 0).
//
